            {
                "comment": "The worst lecturer.",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 1
            },
            {
                "comment": "Genuinely the worst lecturer I have ever had the displeasure of learning from at UW Madison. Zero of the lectures had any reference to the homework or exams. He would prattle on about his research and his projects. Important info was buried under terrible handwriting and AI overviews. (ironic because he blamed our terrible exam scores on AI)",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 1
            },
            {
                "comment": "Genuinely awful. Like so bad. Lectures off of google AI screenshots and then when everyone does bad on an insanely hard exam unrelated to subjects applicable to class he says everyone is using AI and is stupid. I went to every single lecture and cannot say a single one was worth it. Talks about himself and his research the entire class like I gaf",
                "difficulty_rating": 4,
                "quality_rating": 1
            },
            {
                "comment": "Good guy, horrible lecturer. Dr.B is like the devil ok his shoulder, whispering in his ear about AI and cheating. No wonder she got barred from teaching the course. Easy homework, extremely difficult exam. Smith doesn't prepare you for anything. ",
